<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 21.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 21.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 21	Nov 20	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  236.460     236.900     237.040   -0.24 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.390     303.400     303.640   -0.08 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.825     157.900     165.490   -4.63 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.634	46.682	48.410   -3.67 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  398.140     397.280     366.280    8.70 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.675     140.790     147.886   -4.88 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.804	15.734	14.975    5.54 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  211.840     212.870     230.135   -7.95 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.880	 1.877	 1.939   -3.04 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.563	 1.563	 1.575   -0.76 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.975     186.865     206.030   -9.25 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
